ine-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface truncate\">Swallowfield Depot Restroom</h4>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate\">Swallowfield, St. Andrew • Submitted yesterday</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"flex-shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold\">\n              +15 XP Pending\n            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-sm pt-space-xs\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary\">hourglass_top</span>\n<span>Awaiting moderation</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary\">accessible</span>\n              Includes wheelchair access &amp; customer key info\n            </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- Card 6: Approved (Auto Parts) -->\n<article class=\"contribution-item p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-space-sm transition-transform active:scale-[0.99]\" data-status=\"approved\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start gap-space-sm min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-primary shadow-xs\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\">settings</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col min-w-0\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<h4 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface truncate\">Mario's Auto Parts</h4>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">check_circle</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-varian